# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NB: patterns containing a "/" are anchored to the repo root, so a bare
# "sonic-hybrid/Data/" would NOT match "Hybrid-RSDK-Main/sonic-hybrid/Data/".
# Always use a leading **/ (or a root-anchored path) when the directory can
# appear at more than one depth.
build/
**/build/
**/bin/
**/obj/
Debug/
Release/
.vs/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.tlog
*.obj
*.pch
*.ipch

# vcpkg
vcpkg_installed/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copyrighted game data - NEVER COMMIT
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.rsdk
*.bin
*.sav

# Unpacked/intermediate game data produced by the generator.
# These contain extracted copyrighted assets (.gif/.txt/.ogg/...) that the
# *.bin rule above does not cover.
rsdk-source-data/*
!rsdk-source-data/README.md
Hybrid-RSDK-Main/rsdk-source-data/*
!Hybrid-RSDK-Main/rsdk-source-data/README.md
**/sonic-hybrid/Data/

# Generated Sonic 3 & Knuckles ROM
sonic3.bin
*.gen

# The unified hybrid pack is a build output, not source.
Hybrid-RSDK-Main/sonic-hybrid/Data.rsdk

# RSDKv4 runtime writes these next to the game data / engine.
log.txt
stdout.txt
stderr.txt

# settings.ini is deliberately NOT ignored, despite being runtime-written.
# The engine reads it during Init(), and without [Window] RefreshRate the frame
# loop in RetroEngine::Run() spins without doing any work - which presents as an
# infinite loop with no log output rather than as a missing file. Tracking a
# default means a fresh clone boots; local edits still override it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# C# project files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/launchSettings.json
**/*.user

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE / editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/settings.json
.vs/
*.suo
*.user

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
